          "name": "Allocator",
          "type": "ValueType::AllocatorType&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "ValueType&",
      "docs": "!\nSimilar to Get(), but if the specified value do not exists, it creates all parents and clone the default value.\nSo that this function always succeed.\n\\param root Root value of a DOM sub-tree to be resolved. It can be any value other than document root.\n\\param defaultValue Default value to be cloned if the value was not exists.\n\\param allocator Allocator for creating the values if the specified value or its parents are not exist.\n\\see Create()"
    },
